弱的1名其他友军恢复80% + 10% ATK+本次获得护盾值20%的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","루시우스가 실드를 획득할 때마다 치유의 힘으로 HP가 가장 낮은 1명의 다른 아군 HP를 80% + 10% ATK + 이번에 획득한 실드 수치의 20% 만큼 회복시킨다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":32,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":26,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":50,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","自己受到的护盾效果提升8%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","자신이 받는 실드 효과가 8% 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","自己受到的护盾效果提升14%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","자신이 받는 실드 효과가 14% 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","自己受到的护盾效果提升20%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","자신이 받는 실드 효과가 20% 증가한다."],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/kr","영웅 마스터리"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身治愈。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신의 치료가 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的治愈提升11点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 치료가 11 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的治愈提升15点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 치료가 15 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的治愈提升19点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 치료가 19 증가한다."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","神圣洗礼"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/kr","신성의 세례"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","对面前一片区域内的敌人造成伤害，并降低其攻击力。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/kr","맞은편 구역의 적에게 대미지를 입히고 공격력을 감소시킨다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对面前3格宽、4格长的区域发射圣光，对范围内的所有敌人造成90% ATK伤害，并降低其8%攻击力，持续4秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","맞은편 3×4 구역에 성광을 발사해 범위 내 모든 적에게 90% ATK의 대미지를 입히고 4초간 공격력을 8% 감소시킨다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":32,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","本技能每命中一名敌人，还会使自身获得3% HP的护盾，持续4秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","해당 스킬로 적 1명을 명중할 때마다 자신이 4초간 3% HP의 실드를 획득한다."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":29,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","降低攻击力效果提升至10%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","공격력 감소 효과가 10%로 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","降低攻击力效果提升至12%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","공격력 감소 효과가 12%로 증가한다."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/kr","각성의 힘"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“圣光祝福”治疗的友军数量增加。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/kr","스킬 빛의 축복으로 치료하는 아군의 수량이 증가한다."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“圣光祝福”治疗的友军数量增加1名。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","스킬 빛의 축복으로 치료하는 아군의 수량이 1명 증가한다."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","白色巨塔"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/kr","하얀 거탑"]]}